<!-- Germanic Druid (CR 2) — S2. TWO druids. Stay in zone 9. Chanting buff to all raiders. -->
[h: atk=1d20]
[h: dmg_flame=1d8]
[h: dmg_thunder1=1d8] [h: dmg_thunder2=1d8]
[h: dmg_spike1=1d4] [h: dmg_spike2=1d4]
[h: dmg_shil=1d8]
/me chants and attacks!<br>
<b>CHANTING BUFF (while alive):</b> All Germanic raiders +1 ATK, adv vs fear. Kill = buff ends.<br>
<b>Fog Cloud (Druid A, R1 — Conc):</b> 20ft radius sphere, 120ft range. All inside BLINDED. No save.<br>
<b>Entangle (Druid B, R1 — Conc):</b> STR DC 12 or Restrained (speed 0). 20ft sq, 90ft range. Falls off ladder if restrained.<br>
<b>Produce Flame (cantrip, 30ft):</b> ATK: [e: atk+4] | DMG: [e: dmg_flame+4] fire<br>
<b>Thunderwave (1st, emergency):</b> CON DC 12 or [e: dmg_thunder1+dmg_thunder2] thunder + pushed 10ft. Half on save.<br>
<b>Spike Growth (2nd, Phase 2 — Conc):</b> [e: dmg_spike1+dmg_spike2] piercing per 5ft moved through. 20ft radius, 150ft range.<br>
<b>Hold Person (2nd):</b> WIS DC 12 or Paralyzed (auto-crit all hits). Use on party's best melee fighter.<br>
<b>Shillelagh (emergency melee):</b> ATK: [e: atk+4] | DMG: [e: dmg_shil+2] bludgeoning<br>
<i style='color:#60aa40'>(Never advance past zone 9. Below 10 HP: flee treeline — unit morale drops visibly. Slots: 4×1st, 2×2nd.)</i>
